ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-37265" :question/id #uuid "2265169c-0d8b-562a-b72b-43f80dabce9f" :question/math-academy-id "q-37265" :question/problem "Which of the following sets is a subset of $A={2n∣n\\in N}?$" :question/worked-solution "First, we must find the elements of the set $A.$ The elements of the set \n$A$ are all the natural even numbers.\n\nSo, we have\n\n$$\nA={2,4,6,8,…}.\n$$\n\nNow, a subset of $A$ is a set whose elements are also elements of the set $A.$\n\nIn our case, $B={2,6,12,14,32}$ is a subset of $A.$\n\nIn the rest of the options, the set $B$ has elements that are not in $A,$ meaning that it is not a subset of $A.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-37265/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "b0e5efaa-e624-5045-abdb-cdf8d32ad6cb"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-37265"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id [:question/math-academy-id "q-37255"] :question/problem "Which of the following sets is a subset of $A={{1},{2,3},{1,3,6}}?$\n\n- ${2,{1}}$\n- ${{2,3}}$\n- ${{-1},{1,3,6}}$" :question/worked-solution "A set is a subset of $A$ if all its elements are elements of $A.$ \n\nWith that in mind, let's inspect each option.\n\n- ${2,{1}}$ is *not* a subset of $A$ because it contains the element $2\\notin A.\\,\\times $\n\n- ${{2,3}}$ is a subset of $A.\\,✓$\n\n- ${{-1},{1,3,6}}$ is *not* a subset of $A$ because it contains the element ${-1}\\notin A.\\,\\times $\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"II only\"." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "q-80806/selection/1faedf8ceccc2220b1dfdebcc2706a13abdeccb35e136041656662336414bdeb" :answer/id #uuid "133f8274-a91d-5d42-a160-88045cc2ebc0" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "∅,{-1},{0},{1},{-1,0},{-1,1},{0,1},{-1,0,1}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-80806/selection/0713da40e3d778d75e1ae7e1bfd674537a6bc4f45bf3763ca0c07f1055