$N$" :question/worked-solution "$A$ is a subset of $B$ if every element of $A$ is an element of $B.$\n\nWith that in mind, let's inspect the given choices.\n\n- ${Q}^{+}$ is  a subset of $R.$ Every positive rational number is a real number.\n\n- ${Z}^{-}$ is a subset of $R.$ Every negative integer number is a real number.\n\n- $N$ a subset of $R.$ Every natural number is a real number.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I, II, and III\"." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-506/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "9b7f1d12-3335-5dd7-bf36-e07077d0c45d"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-506"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-105039/selection/c42f019dadccbd9996e4dce4187120308318269e2075531a8100fdebaef4be4b" :answer/id #uuid "adef0a65-5cb8-52ba-8bf7-0637ee4acce7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "N⊆C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-105039/selection/c5570017a795ec2b35ba7572851d960022cfca63cab72c142d68ef1258f8597e" :answer/id #uuid "881498c9-be6f-5efd-a005-ac512575f4a5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "Z⊆Q" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-105039/selection/a42a560b37b2de7964dc32a77378dfd2abd39caf0bd78378c1cba310ed226037" :answer/id #uuid "ea2f1c28-6275-5ddc-8751-ceafc1282548" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{Z}^{-}⊆N" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-105039/selection/608aa8eee889cc9ba516a8468964f58babe8f298be2aea159122552581473af6" :answer/id #uuid "c7982993-e896-5b93-9233-611859b5a7b7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "Q⊆R" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-105039/selection/2520799201045cc7dc06c8256150ce4374f140fa1ff4e1996526da5bd7a711a8" :answer/id #uuid "5e29efb3-1373-5e2e-8d00-795254c1eaa8" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "Q⊆Q" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-105039/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "78636117-3097-5d38-a9ce-05be652b501a" :answer-field/key